		<!-- SECTION 3: Without/With Nexus Comparison -->
		<div class="nexus__sec3">

			<div class="ns3__page ns3__page1">
				<div class="wrap">
					<h2 id='one-powerful-interface-for-intelligence-in-flow-state'  id="boomdevs_2" >One Powerful Interface for Intelligence in Flow State</h2>
											<div class="ns3__content">
							<div class="nsc__left">
								<h4 id='without-nexus'  id="boomdevs_3" >Without <strong>Nexus</strong></h4>
								<p class="para3">Discovery → handoff → Build → handoff → Test → handoff → Deploy → wait for something to break → Fix</p>
								<p class="para1">Most platforms break your work into stages. Discover here. Build there. Test somewhere else. Fix it when it breaks. Your job is to carry context between them and hope nothing gets lost.</p>
								<p class="para2">You are the glue, and the bottleneck.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="nsc__right">
								<div class="nsc__right--wrap">
									<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="976" height="684" src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus-without.webp" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus-without.webp 976w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus-without-300x210.webp 300w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus-without-768x538.webp 768w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus-without-150x105.webp 150w" sizes="(max-width: 976px) 100vw, 976px" />								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
										</div>
				<div class="messyline-div">
					<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="messyline" src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/themes/yellow.ai/img/v2/nexus3-lines2.webp" alt="Messy Line">
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="ns3__page ns3__page2">
				<div class="wrap">
											<div class="ns3__content">
							<div class="nsc__left">
								<h4 id='with-nexus'  id="boomdevs_4" >With Nexus</h4>
								<p class="para3">Describe → Build → Test → Deploy → Self-heal</p>
								<p class="para1">Granular intelligence flowing through everything at scale. When you’re exploring, it’s already finding patterns. When you’re building, it’s already stress-testing. When something breaks, it’s already fixing. Nothing lost. Nothing missed.</p>
								<p class="para2">You are the captain not the bottleneck.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="nsc__right">
								<div class="nsc__right--wrap">
																			<video src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/nexus5-video1.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video>
																		</div>
							</div>
						</div>
										</div>
				<svg width="1400" height="767" viewBox="0 0 1400 767" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
