		<div class="nexus__sec5">
			<div class="wrap">
				<h2 id='what-happens-when-nexus-takes-the-wheel'  id="boomdevs_9" >What Happens When <strong>Nexus</strong> Takes the Wheel</h2>
									<div class="ns5__content">
