							<h4 id='the-instant-analyst'  id="boomdevs_10" >The Instant Analyst</h4>
							<div class="content"><p>Your resolution rate dropped. You don’t know why.</p>
<pre class="strike"><strong>Old way:</strong> Pull logs -&gt; Filter by date -&gt; Read transcripts-&gt; Build a hypothesis -&gt; Test it -&gt; Repeat.</pre>
</div>
