							<div class="content"><p>You need a luxury hotel concierge bot. You have no flows, no intents, no training data.</p>
<pre class="strike"><strong>Old way:</strong> Weeks of scoping -&gt; Requirements docs -&gt; Back-and-forth with engineering -&gt; Maybe a prototype by next quarter.</pre>
</div>
